      "title": "求曲线围成的面积",
      "knowledgeNodeIds": [
        "math-intapp-area-curves"
      ],
      "type": "solution",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "content": "求 $y = x^2$和 $y = x$围成的区域面积。",
      "answer": "$\\frac{1}{6}$",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "交点：$x^2 = x, x(x-1) = 0, x = 0, x = 1$",
        "在 [0,1]上 $x \\ge x^2$，面积 $= \\int_0^1 (x - x^2)dx$",
        "$= [x^2/2 - x^3/3]_0^1 = \\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{1}{6}$"
      ],
      "hints": [
        {
          "level": "L1",
          "text": "先找两条曲线的交点确定积分限。"
        },
        {
          "level": "L2",
          "text": "在 [0,1] 上哪条曲线在上方？"
        },
        {
          "level": "L3",
          "text": "两条曲线有多个交点时，面积积分怎么分段处理？"
        }
      ],
