      "type": "solution",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "content": "求 y = √x 在 [0,4] 上绕 x 轴旋转所得旋转体的体积。",
      "answer": "$8\\pi$",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "$V = \\pi\\int_0^4 [\\sqrt{x}]^2\\,dx = \\pi\\int_0^4 x\\,dx$",
