      "type": "solution",
      "difficulty": 3,
      "content": "求 $y = x^2$在 [0,1]上绕 $y$轴旋转所得旋转体的体积。用柱壳法。",
      "answer": "$\\pi/2$",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "柱壳法绕 $y$轴：$V = 2\\pi\\int_0^1 x\\cdot f(x)dx = 2\\pi\\int_0^1 x\\cdot x^2dx$",
        "$= 2\\pi\\int_0^1 x^3dx = 2\\pi[x^4/4]_0^1 = 2\\pi\\cdot(\\frac{1}{4}) = \\pi/2$"
      ],
      "hints": [
        {
          "level": "L1",
          "text": "柱壳法公式 $V = 2\\pi\\int x\\cdot f(x)dx$，$x$代表什么？"
