      "type": "solution",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "content": "求 $y = x^{3/2}$在 [0,1]上的弧长。",
      "answer": "$\\frac{13\\sqrt{13}-8}{27}$",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "$y' = \\frac{3}{2}x^{1/2}$",
        "$s = \\int_0^1 \\sqrt{1 + \\frac{9}{4}x}\\, dx$",
        "令 $u = 1 + \\frac{9}{4}x,\\, du = \\frac{9}{4}\\,dx$",
        "$= \\frac{4}{9}\\int_1^{13/4} \\sqrt{u}\\, du = \\frac{4}{9}\\cdot\\frac{2}{3}[u^{3/2}]_1^{13/4}$",
        "$= \\frac{8}{27}[(\\frac{13}{4})^{3/2} - 1] = \\frac{13\\sqrt{13} - 8}{27}$"
      ],
      "hints": [
        {
          "level": "L1",
          "text": "弧长公式 $s = \\int\\sqrt{1 + (y')^2}\\,dx$，先求 $y'$。"
