      "type": "solution",
      "difficulty": 3,
      "content": "求 $y = x^2$和 $y = x$围成的区域绕 $x$轴旋转所得体积。",
      "answer": "$2\\pi/15$",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "交点 $x=0, x=1$，在 [0,1]上 $x \\ge x^2$",
        "$V = \\pi\\int_0^1 [x^2 - (x^2)^2]dx = \\pi\\int_0^1 (x^2 - x^4)dx$",
        "$= \\pi[x^3/3 - x^5/5]_0^1 = \\pi(\\frac{1}{3} - \\frac{1}{5}) = 2\\pi/15$"
      ],
      "hints": [
        {
          "level": "L1",
          "text": "两个曲线间的旋转体用「大圆面积减小圆面积」。"
        },
        {
          "level": "L2",
          "text": "外半径 $R = x$，内半径 $r = x^2$，$V = \\pi\\int(R^2 - r^2)dx$。"
        },
